{
  "slug": "canva",
  "name": "Canva",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Create, edit, review, resize, and brand-check Canva designs with the Canva MCP server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `brand-check` (Check a Canva design against a brand kit and report where it diverges — off-palette colors, non-brand fonts,…), `bulk-create` (Bulk-create Canva designs from tabular data using a brand template with autofill fields, producing one design per row), `edit-design` (Make edits to an existing Canva design — change or fix text, replace/insert/delete images and videos, reformat text…), `get-design-feedback` (Read a Canva design and return structured, actionable design feedback — visual hierarchy, copy/messaging, layout & spacing, consistency,…), `implement-feedback` (Implement reviewer feedback on a Canva design), `resize-for-social-media` (Resize a Canva design into multiple social media formats (Facebook post, Facebook story, Instagram post, Instagram story, LinkedIn…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `canva`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install canva@claude-plugins-official` from `canva-sdks/canva-skills` (`plugins/canva`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "mcp": 1
  },
